8a186b5c4e5f209ac1791279842e669bf4d1e726 blob 2050
# One authorized ERE12 actual attempt

Only the exact committed resolved command may be requested with require_escalated,
login:false and no prefix rule, after fresh DATA preflight. No default route or
retry. This directory owns the current preflight, metadata capture and eventual
byte-exact runtime publication. No product or accepted launcher source changes.

The publisher does not choose native goldens. It records statuses, NUL values,
capture hashes, lifecycle observations and owner credit evidence. JSON/Markdown
observations are generated DATA, not changes to the twelve literal programs.
Original runtime files remain under the preprovisioned owned root for independent
artifact audit. No automatic cleanup/renewal of that root or old authority.

Initial tool-shell startup is trusted host outside child environment/raw capture
qualification. Actual Bash children use the accepted exact fresh six-key environment
and literal argv. No native-version probe, external execution, network, private
paths, virtual product, ERE engine, Worker, comparator, P2, XAN or old gate.

Budget accounting: context four known starts; preflight seven (shell/edit/mkdir,
Node syntax/body, two metadata Git children); exact native owner thirteen managed
starts with exec-replaced wrapper roles distinguished from OS starts; publication
seven (shell, Node syntax/body, four Git publication calls). A conservative separate
wrapper-role charge makes 32 total, within 40 all-known starts. Peak three occurs
with shell/Node/Git metadata or shell/owner/case known roles. This is not a kernel
quota or global census. No administrative children run inside the native owner.

The fresh preflight records one 600-second inclusive deadline, covering its tool
checks, native attempt, readback and artifact publication. The accepted owner also
has its own original inclusive 600-second/GO-expiry clamp; this does not extend
the enclosing attempt. Publication must fit the earlier preflight deadline.
No late output can become qualified. Fixed GO expiry remains unchanged.

